flowchart TD
    Start([Investigation Target]) --> CheckType{Target Type?}
    
    subgraph Domain_Flow[Domain Attribution]
        CheckType -->|Domain / FQDN| D1[WHOIS / RDAP Lookup]
        D1 --> D2[DNS / DoH Resolution]
        D2 --> D3[Subdomain / CNAME Search]
        D3 --> D4[CT Logs & Web History]
    end

    subgraph IP_Flow[IP Attribution]
        CheckType -->|IP / CIDR| I1[ASN & GeoIP Lookup]
        I1 --> I2[Tor / Relay Check]
        I2 --> I3[Reverse DNS / PTR]
        I3 --> I4[Abuse & Reputation Check]
    end

    D4 --> ThreatIntel[Threat Intelligence & Correlation]
    I4 --> ThreatIntel
    ThreatIntel --> Report[Generate Report]
